{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7a7af54dd3933bb3","name":"Rotary Blaster Cannon","source":{"id":"source:reference-7a7af54dd3933bb3","title":"Rotary Blaster Cannon","revision":20938,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:50:35Z","sha256":"c40691f14f69a8697a11a21e2a1a0e03b130f347caedce070f61c67c1798a71b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20938","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rotary%20Blaster%20Cannon&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7a7af54dd3933bb3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Rotary Blaster Cannon is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapon"}," that fires a massive spray of blaster bolts at a target. Coming to prominence at the dawn of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", Merr-Sonn's Z-6 Rotary Blaster Cannon is similar to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:485c08c7b8997444"}," in many ways. It is carried by a single heavy-weapons specialist, but unlike most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blasters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blasters"},", the Z-6 Rotary Blaster Cannon does not require a tripod. The weapon is popular among the Clone Troopers of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," because it can be fired from the hip, allowing the wielder to cover a greater fire arc with a single burst. However, the weapon is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Inaccurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inaccurate"}," when the wielder does not take time to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brace"}," it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brace"}," a Rotary Blaster Cannon before firing it, you can choose to target a 2x4 square area (instead of the normal 2x2 square area) with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack. However, if you do not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brace"}," the Rotary Blaster Cannon, you take a -5 penalty to your attack roll in addition to the normal penalties associated with firing a weapon in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," mode.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Rotary Blaster Cannon requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 20 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced. This weapon can also be attached to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"}," for longer use.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," only\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 16 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
